 to crack a mysterious case involving terrorist bombings that seem to be following a clear pattern, but not a clear purpose.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1RrJRWYCeIgjBeDomQuYBQL9Jzj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17711","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156854","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53587","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"70670","synopsis":"On Christmas morning, Brian wakes up to a cyberattack to the Marginal Service, which escalates from embarrassing photos to possible data leakage about the Marginal Service and Borderlanders. Lyra has a good idea of who’s responsible.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Sh39hbcndICuz5Esne0OE77zk4.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17711","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156854","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53587","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"70797","synopsis":"The Marginal Service finds out that Rubber escaped to Higashino Island. They have to get there on a boat, but Cyrus isn't happy about it since he hates nature. Brian happily suggests a fishing contest. But what he manages to catch is a shark.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYBsYb4iFjqjMKbVFijvskzG9eD.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17711","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156854","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53587","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"70873","synopsis":"Brian and Zeno set out to rescue Robin and Bolts, who have fallen into Rubber Suit's clutches. Little do they know that Robin and Bolts are about to discover a secret about their past that will completely upend the mission.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mZAU5c6V5ElIQMW7qEMhI0fIhNL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17711","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156854","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53587","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"71048","synopsis":"The Marginal Service goes to the holding facility converted from a mall, where Rubber is being transferred. After Cyrus conducts a medical check up on Rubber, something strange starts to happen.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iAPH7l2z1VRvmVESqyFdnhEnhVf.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17711","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156854","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53587","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214211","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427027","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"71189","synopsis":"Rubber is in custody with the higher ups at the UN. Zeno is upset that he can't interrogate Rubber, and suspects that Theodore's hiding somethin